SUMMARY:West 94th Street Pub: Friendsgiving Pie Potluck
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWest 94th Street back at it again wi
 th having us at their space for the holidays! This time it's a Friendsgivi
 ng Pie Potluck.\n\nThere will be drinks specially crafted for us🍹\n\nTh
 e space will be open for us to get together and share some time with one a
 nother...as well a pie potluck🥧\n\n**Bring a pie creation to share!** I
 t will be tons of fun\, Kerry is awesome and loves opening the bar for the
  community 🫂\n\nHopefully we'll see you there.\n\nFavorite pie gets a p
 rize from me cause why not lol👀
