SUMMARY:Festival of Lights - Hillridge Farm
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nJoin us for a magical evening surrou
 nded by thousands of Christmas lights and displays! We will be meeting at 
 the Zackery Michael Office and can carpool from there. Tickets are purchas
 ed upon arrival to the farm and are $19.95 per person. Following our wagon
  ride through the lights and time exploring the farm we can head out to gr
 ab some dinner.\n\nFor more information visit the link below.\n[https://ww
 w.hillridgefarms.com/](https://www.hillridgefarms.com/)
