SUMMARY:NC Chinese Lantern Festival
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWe invite you to join us for one of 
 the most mezmerizing light festivals of North Carolina: The NC Chinese Lan
 tern Festival! It is strongly encouraged to purchase tickets ahead of time
  if you plan to attend as nights do tend to sell out. You can purchase tic
 kets here: [https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/52222336/2026-north-carolina-chi
 nese-lantern-festivalevening-session-cary-koka-booth-amphitheatre?displayT
 ype=List](https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/52222336/2026-north-carolina-chine
 se-lantern-festivalevening-session-cary-koka-booth-amphitheatre?displayTyp
 e=List)\n"Experience the magic of the North Carolina Chinese Lantern Festi
 val returns to Koka Booth Amphitheatre in Cary for its eleventh year\, now
  through January 10\, 2027. Wander through all-new\, larger-than-life lant
 ern displays created by Chinese artisans\, each composed of hundreds of in
 dividual pieces and illuminated by thousands of LED lights\, and enjoy nig
 htly cultural arts performances on the main stage(https://www.boothamphith
 eatre.com/nc-chinese-lantern-festival/)."
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31755
 7864/
